install additional build dependencies, they will be listed in error log during build of pip wheels.

using UV, which has it's own dependency checker.

in requirements.txt change:
    greenlet==3.1.1 to greenlet>=3.1.1

in odoo/tools/misc.py
    add:
    copy method
        def copy(self):
            return self.__class__(self)

    to
        class OrderedSet(MutableSet[T], typing.Generic[T])

in odoo/tools/safe_eval.py
    add:
        "LOAD_SMALL_INT", to _EXPR_OPCODES
        "NOT_TAKEN", to _EXPR_OPCODES
        "LOAD_FAST_BORROW", to _EXPR_OPCODES

then run:
    python odoo-bin --addons-path=<addons-path> -d <your-db-name> -i base,web


and go to:
    http://localhost:8069/
